==Event Information==
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''The Battle Cats'''}} meet the magical girls of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-'''}} for a limited-time collab event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available May 27th (11am) through June 10th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Limited "Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-" Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
For a short time only, select the Puella Magi Madoka Magica set at the Rare Capsule menu to recruit awesome magical girl heroes into your Cat Army!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Collab-only Units available in this set include:'''}}<br>
[[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Bebe (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks with 100% chance to weaken Aliens and Zombies!<br>
Level it up to reveal its evolution into {{Color|#AA33CC|'''Nagisa and Cat'''}}!<br>
[[Madoka Kaname (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Madoka Kaname (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A long-range specialist delivering powerful anti-Floating attacks with 100% chance of Slow!<br>
[[Sayaka Miki (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Sayaka Miki (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Her area attacks gain power as she takes damage, and she survives one lethal attack!<br>
[[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Can only attack enemies at a distance, but has superior range and delivers massive damage vs Angels!<br>
[[Kyoko Sakura (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Kyoko Sakura (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to knockback and weaken Red enemies!<br>
[[Homura Akemi (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Homura Akemi (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to Freeze Black enemies!<br>
[[Kyubey (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Kyubey (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Aliens, with a chance to survive lethal attacks!<br>
[[Madoka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Madoka Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|''','''}} [[Sayaka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sayaka Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|''','''}} [[Mami Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Mami Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|''','''}} [[Kyoko Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Kyoko Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|''','''}} [[Homura Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Homura Cat'''}}]] {{Color|#FF00CC|'''(Rare)'''}}<br>
Battle Cat reimaginings of your favorite magical girls!<br>
Don't miss out!<br>
<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-" collab units from the "Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-" capsule set. "Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-" units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If "Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION-" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Maps in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Challenge specials stages to destroy the witches' labyrinth! "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" characters appear as enemies! Visit the Legend Stories to take on these limited edition event maps!

・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Puella Magi Madoka Magica"'''}}<br>
Get a chance to collect [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Li'l Madoka'''}}]] each time you clear one of the event stages. And remember, your chances are better when you play more difficult stages in the map!<br>
(Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} guarantee of picking up stage rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Witch's Labyrinth"'''}}<br>
Enjoy collab-only stages with Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -REBELLION- backgrounds and themes on the The Rose Garden Witch, The Dessert Witch, and The Box Witch stages!<br>
During this crossover event, stages featuring terrifying Witch enemies will appear on a blitz schedule at the times below. You won't know which Witch will be attacking until you enter the map!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''6:00am～9:00am / 12:00pm～3:00pm / 6:00pm～9:00pm / 9:00pm～0:00am'''}}

Get a chance to collect [[Kyubey Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Kyubey Cat'''}}]] each time you clear one of these event stages. And remember, your chances are better when you play more difficult stages in the series!<br>
(Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} guarantee of picking up stage rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

After unlocking Kyubey Cat, remember to activate him by visiting the Rare Cat section of the Upgrade menu!

・Collab Map{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Walpurgisnacht"'''}}<br>
Clear this stage for a chance to unlock {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Li'l Madoka's'''}} True Form!<br>
The "Walpurgisnacht" stage will appear starting {{Color|#FF0000|'''Day 3 of the collab (May 30th 12:00am)!'''}} Can you defeat this Deadly challenge?!

・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"A Fake Mitakihara"'''}}<br>
Save the half-baked witch! Clear this stage for a chance to unlock [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Li'l Homura's'''}}]] True Form!<br>
The "A Fake Mitakihara" stage will appear starting {{Color|#FF0000|'''Day 7 of the collab (June 3rd 12:00am)!'''}} Can you defeat this Deadly challenge?!<br>
<small><small>※ Li'l Madoka will be available to collect from the Puella Magi Madoka Magica stage, and Li'l Homura will be available to collect as a free campaign reward when visiting the Cat Base any time from May 31st through June 10th.<br>
※ You can activate Li'l Madoka at the Rare Cats section, and Li'l Homura at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!<br>
※ Li'l Madoka / Li'l Homura may be upgraded to their True Forms after reaching Level 20.<br>
※ If Walpurgisnacht/A Fake Mitakihara is cleared before the character is collected, it is possible that you may unlock the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.</small></small>

Plus, get a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''first-time clear reward of 30 Cat Food'''}} when you achieve victory on all stages on any of these maps!<br>
<small><small>※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

