{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn cool bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Puella Magi Madoka Magica events!<br>
<small><small>※Puella Magi Madoka Magica Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until June 10th, 2019 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for another login stamp!'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and unlock a Rare Ticket or useful battle items.
